{
    "title": "Monster Maker",
    "description": "Create amazing and funny characters, your own mascot, a movie Monster , or maybe minions of heroes or your favorite villains.\r\n\r\nOr if you prefer to take a selfie and turn yourself into funny monsters by applying eyes, mouth and fun accessories! And why not do it with your friends or pets?\r\n\r\nUse your creativity and imagination to build characters part by part. And choose the background you want. Create as many monsters as you want, there are thousands of possible combinations!\r\n\r\nImagine them, create them, save them and share them with your friends and family through WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook and all your favorite social networks.\r\n\r\nPROMOTES CREATIVITY\r\n\r\nThis is a fun game for the whole family, where children can share time with their parents or family and play at being creative.\r\n\r\nThe different combinations of bodies, eyes, noses and mouths, complementing them with fun accessories such as hats, mustaches, glasses and many other things, allow to create infinite facial expressions, such as happy, angry and surprised, among others.\r\n\r\nHOW TO USE\r\n\r\n- Select a background.\r\n- Select a body or take a picture of a landscape or object or take a selfie.\r\n- add eyes, mouth and place accessories (glasses, hats, horns, wigs, bows, among many options).\r\n- If you want to delete an object, drag it to the garbage basket and Ready !. You can also press the basket to remove all objects.\r\n- You can enlarge or shrink each object by touching it repeatedly.\r\n- Save your creations in the album to see them or share them at any time.\r\n- Share your monsters on Facebook, Twitter, WhatsApp, Instagram, email or share it through the most popular social networks.\r\n\r\nCHARACTERISTICS\r\n\r\n- Beautiful colorful designs that will delight big and small.\r\n- Intuitive and easy to use for all ages.\r\n- Content totally free!\r\n\r\n--- Do you like our free application? ---\r\nHelp us and take a few moments to write your opinion on Google Play.\r\nYour contribution allows us to improve and develop new applications for free !.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Create amazing and funny characters, your own mascot, a movie Monster , or maybe minions of heroes or your favorite villains.<br><br>Or if you prefer to take a selfie and turn yourself into funny monsters by applying eyes, mouth and fun accessories! And why not do it with your friends or pets?<br><br>Use your creativity and imagination to build characters part by part. And choose the background you want. Create as many monsters as you want, there are thousands of possible combinations!<br><br>Imagine them, create them, save them and share them with your friends and family through WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook and all your favorite social networks.<br><br>PROMOTES CREATIVITY<br><br>This is a fun game for the whole family, where children can share time with their parents or family and play at being creative.<br><br>The different combinations of bodies, eyes, noses and mouths, complementing them with fun accessories such as hats, mustaches, glasses and many other things, allow to create infinite facial expressions, such as happy, angry and surprised, among others.<br><br>HOW TO USE<br><br>- Select a background.<br>- Select a body or take a picture of a landscape or object or take a selfie.<br>- add eyes, mouth and place accessories (glasses, hats, horns, wigs, bows, among many options).<br>- If you want to delete an object, drag it to the garbage basket and Ready !. You can also press the basket to remove all objects.<br>- You can enlarge or shrink each object by touching it repeatedly.<br>- Save your creations in the album to see them or share them at any time.<br>- Share your monsters on Facebook, Twitter, WhatsApp, Instagram, email or share it through the most popular social networks.<br><br>CHARACTERISTICS<br><br>- Beautiful colorful designs that will delight big and small.<br>- Intuitive and easy to use for all ages.<br>- Content totally free!<br><br>--- Do you like our free application? ---<br>Help us and take a few moments to write your opinion on Google Play.<br>Your contribution allows us to improve and develop new applications for free !.",
